sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Reversal Worker
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Bank as Bank Core Adapter
  participant R as Reconciliation Worker
  W->>DB: Persist operationRef=op-123, status=pending
  W->>Bank: POST reversal op-123
  Bank->>Bank: Applies reversal once
  Bank--xW: Timeout / network failure
  W->>DB: Mark outcomeUnknown
  Note over W,Bank: Never issue a new operation reference
  R->>DB: Find outcomeUnknown op-123
  R->>Bank: GET status by op-123
  Bank-->>R: confirmed + amount/currency
  R->>DB: Atomic status + timeline + outbox
  Note over DB: Customer sees FundsConfirmed only now
